# Casa del Trueque (C3, contract 34), 9 x 7, interior. column = i, row = j. A harbour trader's front room: net racks, lobster traps, crates and a barrel, a table
# and the trader (`trueque`). creature-for-creature trade: he wants a JABBIRD and gives an OTTEROCK whose nickname is the fixed ASCII text `trueque.nick` (Pipo, the same in all
# four languages; contract 32.5). Flag 54 = the trade was done. Species ids: jabbird 30, otterock 61 (species.toml positions).
@map casa_trueque
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@flag pipo_done 54
@var pp_res 5
@var pp_want 6
@var pp_give 7
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  N  object=net_rack
  H  object=crate_plain
  x  object=barrel
  t  object=trap
  T  object=table
  B  object=bookshelf interact=look text=trueque.books
  L  npc=trueque id=trader face=S script=trader
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwwywwyww
  |NN..B.H.
  |...L..x.
  q.....T..
  |t.......
  |t.......
  |...mm...
@warp m -> puerto_dinamo spawn=trueque_door
@script trader npc
    npc_face_hero trader
    setv pp_want 30
    setv pp_give 61
    name_var 0 pp_want
    name_var 1 pp_give
    jf pipo_done after
    say trueque.hello
    ask trueque.ask
    jv 0 1 go
    say trueque.no
    end
  go:
    trade jabbird otterock trueque.nick pp_res
    jv pp_res 1 done
    jv pp_res 255 cancel
    say trueque.wrong
    end
  cancel:
    say trueque.no
    end
  done:
    setf pipo_done
    say trueque.done
    end
  after:
    name_var 0 pp_give
    say trueque.after
@end
